# CV Project: Agent Context & Learnings

**Last Updated:** [DATE]
**Purpose:** Provide future agents with comprehensive context for CV optimization work

---

## 1. Project Context

This project helps [YOUR NAME] improve their CV, LinkedIn profile, and job application materials for [TARGET LEVEL] roles.

### Target Roles
1. **[Role 1]** - Key focus areas, skills needed
2. **[Role 2]** - Key focus areas, skills needed
3. **[Role 3]** - Key focus areas, skills needed

### Project Goals
- Analyze work history from multiple sources (CV, LinkedIn, blog, articles, documents)
- Build comprehensive skills inventory and achievements database
- Generate role-specific CV versions
- Produce LinkedIn optimization recommendations

---

## 2. Key Files & Structure

```
├── CLAUDE.md                           # Project instructions (read first)
├── AGENTS.md                           # This file - agent context
├── config.yaml                         # User config (gitignored) - has URLs, paths
│
├── sources/                            # INPUT: Raw materials
│   ├── current-cv/[NAME].pdf           # Original CV
│   ├── linkedin/                       # LinkedIn export
│   ├── articles/                       # Press, awards, published articles
│   └── documents/                      # Other relevant docs
│
├── analysis/                           # Research & findings
│   ├── achievements/achievements.md    # Main achievement database
│   └── skills-inventory/skills.md      # Comprehensive skills by category
│
└── outputs/                            # Generated materials
    ├── cv-versions/                    # Role-specific CVs (MD, HTML, PDF)
    ├── linkedin-updates/               # Profile recommendations
    └── applications/                   # Per-job application packages
```

