## 4. Critical Context for CV Writing

### MUST USE - Verified High-Impact Facts

**Key Metrics:**
- [Users/customers served]
- [Team size managed]
- [Budget responsibility]
- [Revenue influenced]

**Awards & Recognition:**
- [Award 1] ([Year])
- [Award 2] ([Year])

**Notable Facts:**
- [Impressive client/company names]
- [Scale achieved]
- [Geographic reach]

