## 8. Session Checklist for Agents

### Starting a Session
- [ ] Read CLAUDE.md for project rules
- [ ] Read this AGENTS.md for context
- [ ] Check `outputs/applications/` for in-progress applications
- [ ] Review any new files in sources/
- [ ] Greet the user with relevant context

### Making Changes
- [ ] Verify all metrics against achievements.md
- [ ] Don't fabricate - only use documented facts
- [ ] Update achievements.md with any new information
- [ ] **CHECKIN with the user** before moving to next phase

### Key Reminders
- [Verified fact #1 that agents should use]
- [Verified fact #2 that agents should use]

